SF0155 International physician licensing.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Driskill, Anderson, Brennan, Dockstader
and Schuler
AN ACT relating to physicians and surgeons; authorizing the state board of
medicine to provide provisional medical licenses to international physicians as
specified; providing definitions; making conforming amendments; requiring
rulemaking; and providing for effective dates.
